Package: lasagna
Type: Package
Title: Multi-Layer Graph Analysis for Multi-Omics Data
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ivo", "Kwee", email = "ivo.kwee@bigomics.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("BigOmics Analytics SA", role = c("cph", "fnd")))
Description: LASAGNA (multi-layer graph analysis) builds multi-partite
    graphs from multi-omics data layers and solves for condition-specific
    subnetworks. Edges between layers are weighted by feature-feature
    correlation and can be conditioned on a phenotype of interest. The
    package provides interactive 2D and 3D visualisations of the resulting
    networks using plotly and visNetwork.
